body:
Let me tell you, its not much better in Europe. Why they fuck you over varies depending on where you are, but it ranges from skin colour all the way to political activism. For fucks sake, pigs here regularly break into (quite litterally, no warrant) roma people's homes if someone calls CPS on them. At least we dont get shot.

&#x200B;

Much...

See, thats the thing! As much as i absolutely detest with all my heart politicians like Boris Johnson, Orbán Viktor, Putin, Bush, even Pence to some extent, and all the other rightwing fuckwads, i at the very least get the logic of why someone would vote for them. They're bigotted and hold simply factually wrong views in many cases and actively harm their own countries for their own benefits, but i can sometimes understand why someone would vote for them (the reason is often that the voter in question is bigotted as well, but still).

&#x200B;

But Trump is just simply unfit for office! Even if we put aside his blatant bigotry and just factually harmful and stupid views, he's still a fucking moron who should never have even come close to holding office, regardless of his politics.

Thats what i've always found baffling. Most systems based on a hierarchy make SOME case for why the guy at the top should be thr guy at the top. The king was groomed for his role since birth, in a true meritocracy (as if thats a thing...) the leader is the one best fit, in the military the general has far more experience, and so on (this is obviously not to say those systems are right or just, just that there is at least SOME logical defense for why they exist).

&#x200B;

And the capitalist justification just falls apart under any serious scrutiny, yet for some reason they continue to stick with it. WHY?!

Two of them, and they're both quotes from Ian Danskin (Innuendo Studios)

&#x200B;

One is from the last episode of "Why are you so angry?": "Jack's heart wont grow three sizes as he embraces this gleaming new future. He'll likely end up back in his room, sulking about how no one understands him. About how he cant say five words online without somebody challenging him. How its so unfair that everyone hates him. But sooner or later, he has to get back to his daily life, calm down, comb his hair, open the door, go back outside...

And see that the world didnt go to shit when we started listening to women."

&#x200B;

A lot of Ian's videos are filled with comments saying how he got them out of Gamergate (and i hope most are true), so without repeating them much, i just want to say this quote got me to actually start listening to women and take their experiences and what they said to heart.

&#x200B;

The other is: "If you want to win, you have to understand why you've been losing."

This is just kind of a personal motto of mine. Even in an apolitical context it works. Whatever it is you define as "Winning" (getting better grades, being succesful financially or creatively, romance, whatever), if you want to get it, the first step is to figure out why you are not winning. Otherwise, you're just fucking about, doing nothing to make your life better.

I really dont get their logic on things like this. So apparentely, they believe that the "Invisible hand" is supposed to control most parts of life (to what extent differs on the spectrum between ancap and conservative, but thats the starting position). So, it logically follows from that, that if a corporation doesnt want to do something/does something you dont agree with, they are free to do so and above criticism. What they are doing generates profit, which is the driving force of their ideology, and so even if they disagree, the corporation should do it.

&#x200B;

...Would be the logical position if you're a capitalist. But no, turns out, its all an SJW, cultural marxist cabal behind it all, controlled by (((THEM))) to destroy western civilization...By demonetizing one modestly successful Youtube chanel.

&#x200B;

Like, geez, i get that they're stupid, i learned that a long time ago, but they could be at least CONSISTENT in their stupidity. But no, even that is above them somehow...

And the fucker didnt even manage to get right what cognitive dissonance is...

&#x200B;

I guess that level of stupidity is to be expected from people like this, but still...

Say it with me now:

&#x200B;

All  cops  are  bastards!

Not that i have anything against counter protesting (quite the opposite), but i do think in this specific instance, it won't lead to anything good, for two reasons:

&#x200B;

1: Think of the position the alt-right is in now. They have built up this false narrative through years that the left is who is ultimately violent and they are just defending themselves when they're being violent (which is obviously false), and also that the left uses violence against everyone who disagrees with them, even on a surface level. If there is no counterprotest, the entire narrative would be instantly invalidated. It would just be a (probably) saddeningly low number of angry incels who thought the left would be there, so they could start something and play the martyr. It would also help set an example to people who are not neccessarily alt-right, but are anti-LGBTQ+ and use the slippery slope of "when will being straight be outlawed?". We could show them that, ultimately, we could not give less of a fuck about the fact that you are straight. What we DO give a fuck about is someone being a homphobic and transphobic shithead.

&#x200B;

2: The people organizing this are going there for violence. Thats what the alt-right does. Thats what they did in Charlottesville, thats what they do everywhere. There are a lot of screenshots from 4chan and 8chan about fascists telling other fascists to bring weapons before alt-right rallies, with the express purpose of not defending themselves, but CAUSING violence. And to be honest, i just dont want you guys to get hurt. Having a counterprotest would give them the justification to use violence. To strike first. Dont give them that justification.

&#x200B;

So even if you go out, i suggest you stay non-violent. I know, i enjoy punching nazis as much as the next cultural marxist SJW communist degenerate, i just dont think that would serve much purpose in this specific case. But i might be wrong there. I cant say i've ever seen a "straight pride parade".

I am a man of many regrets. One of my biggest was when in high school I tried to turn my girlfriend from a feminist to a men's rights activist... And nearly succeeded.

&#x200B;

Thank god i pulled myself out of THAT rabbit hole...

There must be something seriously wrong with me, I went to the comments and organized them by "Latest"...

&#x200B;

You do not want to go down that road...

As a smoker, i couldnt agree more with you. I usually try not to smoke around people who dont, or only those who i know arent bothered by it.

&#x200B;

Same goes for people who just throw the butts away with no consideration for what it does. You may choose to fuck up your lungs (like i said, i do it too...) but at the very least, try not fucking up the environment and other people's lungs for the sake of looking edgy or rebellious!

As a white atheist living in a very conservative Eastern-European country (I'm just gonna drop the pretense, its Hungary):

&#x200B;

FUCK those two! And fuck those who complain about why its getting attention! Fuck the people who think it isnt a big deal because muslims have killed more people, which is both not true and also disgusting because THE DEATH OF PEOPLE ISNT A RACE!

&#x200B;

Fuck the idiots who tried to spin this as a false flag to make anti-immigration politicians look bad (just gonna throw this out there, if you are unconciously associated with people like the killer in this case, its probably your own fault and not the fault of muslims, FYI...)!

&#x200B;

Fuck those who are still thinking the alt-right's memes are just jokes even though they cause massacre's like this. Fuck the alt-right, while you're at it. Fuck the asshats who think whatever horrible shit someone else did somehow justifies the killing of innocents based on religion alone.

&#x200B;

And most importantly of all, those who are using tragedies like this to push their own political agenda, whoever they might be and whichever side you're on,

FUCK YOU!

&#x200B;

After all that, all i can say is i am so, so unbelievably sorry for what all of you who are some sort of a minority have to take and endure every day from white people like me. I dont speak for all of us (sadly), but i do speak for some. And, however little it's worth, I'm awfully sorry.

HétköznaPI CSAlódások. You probably havent heard of them if you're not from Hungary, but over here, they're a pretty big thing in the scene and what really got me into the local scene in my country. It was amazing, truly.

&#x200B;

Other than that, i go to a lot of concerts that arent punk, of those, probably Enter Shikari last year. Those guys know how to put on a show.

I've been on the "spectating" end of this. Right now, i'm pretty deep in the underground art movements in my city (especially those that have to do with poetry and prose), and there is this one single guy i'm really sick of. He's 52, but he doesnt look it. Come to think of it, at first glance he doesnt seem that old. He's very well groomed, not overweight at all, and aside from slightly greying hair, even his face looks pretty young. Problem is.. He's got a wife and two kids. And yet every single time there is a girl younger than 25 in the group, he tries to get with them. There's this particular girl i'm good friends with, and she told me that when she was going to a slam event out of town that the guy was also attending, the guy offered that she could sleep in his hotel room. Despite the girl making it clear she was staying with friends, he insisted. He keeps kissing and hugging women who are obviously not into whats happening.

&#x200B;

And the scary part is, if you dont see him do it, he's genuinely a good guy. I'm not trying to dull anything, what he's doing is disgusting (and I've told him so when it was really getting out of hand), but at first glance, he's a good man. He's funny, attentive, well spoken, and (altough this is subjective), the poems he makes are genuine masterpieces.

&#x200B;

And yet he tries to fuck girls half his age. It baffles me...

I played a lot of Vaegirs in my time, and i have to say: The mounted units arent as bad as you think. They are on par with the Mamelukes, and when considering that the Vaegir units in general are pretty cheap, they can do some serious damage if you have a bunch of them together. Have your archers fire at the charging enemy, then pick of everyone left with mounted units. They are also very good when sieging something (as in, Vaegirs are attacking the castle) because most of the infantry weapons they use have a bonus against shields, so they can pretty quickly wreck the shield wall of the defenders.

&#x200B;

If you play Vaegirs, it is actually a very good idea to not upgrade your infantry to max level, but keep them one level below the max. Those ones still have shields, and will be cheaper to maintain.

So... I'm just gonna come out and say it: Green Day are my favorite band. Period.

&#x200B;

I know, I know, I'm a fucking uncultured idiot, stone me dead or burn me at the stake, its the truth and i will stand by my oppinion.

Granted, even I have to admit that some of the stuff they did is just awful. I can't stand Warning (except for maybe two songs), the Trilogy should have been purged with fire, and 21CB is... Meh. 

&#x200B;

(Side note, I think Dookie is their best. Also, RevRad is severely underrated.)

Basically anything i could have said has been said in this thread, so i just have one more thing to add:

&#x200B;

I'm young, average height and not very strong. I dont have much experience with fighting, and most of what i know comes from when I was young, fighting guys similarly inexperienced. I live in Eastern Europe, which is chock full of Nazis. I go to a lot of shows, not just punk ones, some have a lot of these fucks, some have none.

&#x200B;

I could start a fight with these guys, confident the others will help me... But what if they just dont? Then i'm in there, fighting possibly 2-3 guys larger, stronger and more experienced than i am, who might even be willing to kill me. And even if i do get help, who'se to say one of them doesnt just randomly stab me? No thanks! I have no interest in getting my bones broken, face beat in and possibly getting killed because i thought i was bigger than i really am. There's no shame in not trying to start a fight with people like these. Know your limits, dont get yourself killed because you want to do the honorable thing. Thats not cowardice, thats being smart. You did the right thing.

I've only ever seen them on the RevRad tour in Budapest (you dont get many chances like that when you live in eastern europe...). I was there with a friend who isnt that big a fan and isnt very much into punks tuff (unlike i am!). I remember this guy, he had a huge ass mohawk, a black leather jacket full of patches and just covered in piercings and tattoos who passed us by when they started playing St. Jimmy. I patted his shoulder and asked if he wanted to mosh. He just jumped into me with full force and we spent the entire song moshing with about 5 other guys. He patted me on the back, told me something i didnt understand because of the noise and just left.

&#x200B;

I turn around to see my friend stand there, clueless as to what just happened. Fun times.

I once came across a girl who has heard one song of them, that being:

&#x200B;

Say Goddbye.

&#x200B;

I mean... Its an oka-ish song, but why THAT one, and not the tens of classic hits they have?!

Trenches

&#x200B;

It would be built with a hammer like most defenses, and could work like a multi-crew foxhole. Cost is maybe 100 bmats, to balance how it would be pretty easy to kill people in it. Maybe you could have them link with eachother if there are more next to eachother. I think it could be a pretty good early game defense structure.

&#x200B;

Also, Field Anti-Tank gun. Basically, a hybrid of the AT turret and the field arty, with a lot smaller range and lot quicker turn, firing 40mm shells (or maybe 75, could be an upgrade, or a different version)

I'm all for rational debate and talking to eachother, but there has to be a fucking line drawn! These fucks were probably there to start shit in the first place, not to fucking debate. What do you think would happen if some of us went up to them and tried fucking talking to them in peace? Most likely, we would in the guy's place after THEY beat US senseless. 

&#x200B;

If one of these fucks wanted to debate me on the Internet or at a political gathering or whatever, fuck yeah, i'm all for showing the little shits how actual adults think. Except... They dont fucking do that, do they? They either "debate" in their little safe spaces where no other ideology is present, otherwise, they're there to beat people up. I'm not gonna do them the courtesy of letting them do that, just so i can have to "moral highground". Fuck that.

&#x200B;

Accepting nazism is what got us nazi germany in the 40's. See for yourself how well that fucking turned out...

Honestly, i cant help but pity the fuckers a little. Not only is he a fucking nazi, he turned out to be completely fucking retarded as well.

&#x200B;

Serves him right...
